  "notes": [
    "All p.53–62 photos and p.63 boundary were visually checked. p.61 has six independent animal headwords; p.62 is blank. p.63 begins Unit 07.",
    "27 numbered + 18 independently headed unnumbered terms = 45 heads. dirt is a headword omitted from the old MD list. educator/education/prepare/airliner/anyway/doll and extension animals remain supplements.",
    "Old raw capture absent under missing and = car under automobile are not present on the original page and are excluded. lost is printed 似 on p.54, not an antonym.",
    "roast includes adj.; vision includes 影／幻像; parrot includes vt. The headword practically reads 實際地; its explicit almost note is retained separately.",
    "Starred suspect, knuckle, sneaker, impassioned, launch and be not cut out sth are retained. The last label is transcribed as printed without silently adding for.",
    "oxen is preserved as the explicit plural form in usage, not mapped automatically to ox. roasted, auto, HQ and koala bear use exact dictionary lookup only.",
    "Least said, soonest mended. is a running example/proverb sentence, excluded together with all running examples. Printed extension labels do not create semantic or morphological rules.",
    "Mapping is exact headword or an explicitly stored existing wordVariants entry; actual officialWord is preserved. No fuzzy matching or new alias is created."
  ]
}
